WEBVTT

00:12:29.360 --> 00:12:31.980
and look for anything that's changed.

00:12:33.167 --> 00:12:35.745
This is the Vera Rubin Observatory

00:12:35.769 --> 00:12:37.023
in Chile.

00:12:37.047 --> 00:12:41.004
Now, when I visited it back in March,
it was still under construction.

00:12:41.028 --> 00:12:44.198
But this telescope
will begin observations next year,

00:12:44.222 --> 00:12:45.412
and when it does,

00:12:45.436 --> 00:12:50.174
it will carry out a simple
but spectacular observing program.

00:12:50.734 --> 00:12:54.500
This telescope will photograph
the entire southern sky

00:12:54.524 --> 00:12:56.064
every few days

00:12:56.088 --> 00:12:57.270
over and over,

00:12:57.294 --> 00:12:59.111
following a preset pattern

00:12:59.135 --> 00:13:01.017
for 10 years.